 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Gifts. Information costs, *bhau*. So do favours.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "When we reach the hall, remember that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (small, soft)"
   ],
   "text": "This is only one claw. The kingdom itself is the beast.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "The king is in council. You are expected.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Marthanda Varma. And his diwan.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Remember what I said about gifts.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Your Majesty. This is the Maratha rider I wrote of.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "He comes from Portuguese chains and storm water, and he carries knowledge of both.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The Maharaja asks if you were on the ship that broke near our fishermen's village.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. I was.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "He asks if you rode for the Peshwa.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I did.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You raided Portuguese outposts on the western roads that feed their ports.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I did.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "They questioned you.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They tried.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Sit. Speak. Tell him how they fight now on your coast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "How their forts stand, how their captains think, how quickly they bring ships when a local chief resists.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "At Chaul and Daman they build bastions thick and low, so cannonballs skip off instead of biting deep.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Our clerks said their padres walk ahead of the soldiers talking of one God, while the men behind count how many guns a king can spare.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We heard of rajas who signed, thinking European friends would keep neighbours away. They had invited a hungry wolf into their courtyards.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off, in the inset)"
   ],
   "text": "And their infantry do not know what to do with sudden horse on the flank.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Here. This river mouth. How many days from their nearest stronghold at full sail?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If the wind favours them, three days. Four if they are unlucky.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Longer if someone whispers wrong directions into the ear of a pilot.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (sharp)"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You mistrust pilots?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I mistrust everyone who touches a coin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "But men who steer ships can be made to see profit in many directions.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Ram.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (soft)"
   ],
   "text": "Already marked, Maharaja.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "He says you speak as if you have counted men and ships for years.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Yet your own masters failed to keep you from their dungeons.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Any war has its losses. I misjudged a patrol near the coast. I paid the price.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That does not make my other calculations less true.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "He says, perhaps.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "And he asks Ibrahim if he trusts you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "As far as one can trust a man who owes you his life and hates the same enemies.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Beyond that, trust is for priests.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "He says they already have horse from the Nayak of Madurai, and Nair warriors who fight on foot or on small horses in this soil.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They have Dutch fortifications in their minds, thanks to other Europeans who chose to be practical rather than loyal.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He asks what you add that he does not already have.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You have horse from Madurai. You have Nair warriors who know this land as they know their own pulse.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You have guns and forts and men from across the sea who teach you how Europeans think.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "What you do not yet have is someone who has ridden into a European line and felt it break.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kanka",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Someone who has watched their neat formations falter not from fear of God, but because a hoof struck at the right moment in the right place.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kanka",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I can help you turn speed into a weapon against men who think their guns make them untouchable.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I can show your riders where to strike, when to pull away, how to make men who drilled on flat European fields die confused on this coast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Ram.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The Madurai horsemen know the straight charge. They do not know the feint and vanish the way Deccan riders do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Our Maravar riders fight bravely, but not yet with discipline against guns.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You could help shape that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "He says I always see the two faces of the coin. And he says, very well, Nagoji Sawant.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "For now, you are not a guest. You are not yet a servant either.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You are an experiment.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "[in Malayalam]",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Outside this fort a strip of shore runs along the sea, too wet for most cavalry, too narrow for big batteries. It is where the Dutch will expect us to be weakest.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Take the Madurai horse and a hundred Maravar riders, and show him something there he has not already imagined.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If you are wrong, you will find Travancore worse than the Portuguese.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
